// graph, and until now that somebody was TypeScript (`harness/wacFiles.ts`). This is the same walk
// in wac, so that a wac program can be the compiler's command line — design/lang/0003 step 4.
//
// **It parses rather than scanning the text.** A regex over the source finds import specifiers
// inside comments and string literals too, so a file that merely *describes* an import in a doc
// comment sends the walker off to read a file that does not exist. The parser has already decided
